    3. Compare with exact field via Calculator:
       - mag(B - B_analytical) gives the pointwise error

  Alternative: Individual files
    - straight_wire_A.xdmf (vector potential)
    - straight_wire_B.xdmf (magnetic field)
    - straight_wire_B_analytical.xdmf (exact field)
    Each also carries the mesh and the CellTags array.

  Alternative: VTX/ADIOS2 directories (EX-14)
    - straight_wire_A.bp/ (vector potential, Lagrange interpolant)
    - straight_wire_B.bp/ (magnetic field, Lagrange interpolant)
    Open the directory itself; ParaView picks the ADIOS2VTXReader.
